 "response": {
  "text": "Haan 👍 ₹3,000 ke andar **proper running ke liye** main fashion sneakers ke bajay cushioning + grip wale shoes loonga. Current options mein ye best lag rahe hain:\n\n### [Decathlon JOGFLOW 100]()\n*₹1,599*\n\n### [Decathlon Jogflow 190.1]()\n*₹2,499*\n\n### [ASICS Jolt 4]()\n*₹2,499*\n\n### [Nike Revolution 7]()\n*₹2,586*\n\n### [Kalenji Run One]()\n*₹999*\n\n### Meri ranking\n\n**🥇 Best overall: Decathlon JOGFLOW 100 — ₹1,599**  \n4,100+ ratings ke saath ye sabse sensible value pick hai. Daily **3–8 km running/walking** ke liye main ise prefer karunga.\n\n**🥈 Best cushioning: Decathlon Jogflow 190.1 — ₹2,499**  \nAgar aap regular running karte ho aur ₹2,500 tak spend kar sakte ho, ye better cushioned option hai.\n\n**🥉 Branded option: ASICS Jolt 4 — ~₹2,499**  \nASICS ka entry-level running shoe; beginner runners ke liye achha option. Current listings mein ₹2,499 ke aas-paas mil raha hai. [magicdrop.in](https://magicdrop.in/drops/best-running-shoes-under-3000?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n**Nike Revolution 7 — ~₹2,586**  \nAgar Nike specifically chahiye, sale price par consider kar sakte ho. Lekin ₹3,000 ke budget mein mujhe Decathlon/ASICS zyada value dete hain.\n\n**💰 Cheapest sensible option: Kalenji Run One — ₹999**  \nAgar abhi running start kar rahe ho aur budget bachana hai, ye kaafi economical choice hai.\n\n**Meri personal pick:** **JOGFLOW 100**. ₹1,599 mein paisa vasool; baaki ₹1,400 bacha kar socks/second pair par laga sakte ho.\n\nAgar tum mujhe **male/female + weight + daily kitne km (3/5/10 km) + road ya treadmill** bata do, main tumhare liye **exact 2–3 shoes** shortlist kar dunga.",
